<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>2026 Data | Premium AI Solutions</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #070b14;
        --bg-2: #120f24;
        --bg-3: #1a1630;
        --panel: rgba(15, 21, 35, 0.8);
        --panel-strong: rgba(11, 17, 28, 0.94);
        --panel-soft: rgba(22, 28, 42, 0.72);
        --line: rgba(158, 176, 214, 0.18);
        --line-strong: rgba(176, 158, 217, 0.26);
        --text: #edf4ff;
        --muted: #a4b3d0;
        --primary: #61a8ff;
        --primary-2: #8577ff;
        --primary-3: #d4a74a;
        --gold: #f5c76d;
        --gold-soft: rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.16);
        --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(3, 6, 18, 0.78);
        --radius: 26px;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(97, 168, 255, 0.18), transparent 22%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 82% 8%, rgba(133, 119, 255, 0.18), transparent 26%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 58% 68%, rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.12), transparent 24%),
          linear-gradient(135deg, #060b12 0%, #0d1322 38%, #100f24 100%);
      }

      a { color: inherit; }

      .page-shell {
        max-width: 1410px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 22px 26px 60px;
      }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
        padding: 18px 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: rgba(10, 15, 24, 0.68);
        backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 44px rgba(7, 11, 20, 0.38);
      }

      .brand {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        min-width: 170px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2), var(--gold));
        color: #07131f;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(98, 119, 255, 0.38);
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 30px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }

      nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
        position: relative;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
      }

      nav a::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        bottom: -8px;
        width: 100%;
        height: 2px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2), var(--gold));
        opacity: 0;
        transform: scaleX(0.6);
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      nav a:hover::after {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scaleX(1);
      }

      .header-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .btn {
        appearance: none;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 999px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .btn-ghost {
        padding: 12px 18px;
        background: rgba(98, 119, 255, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(133, 119, 255, 0.22);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .btn-primary {
        padding: 15px 24px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2), var(--gold));
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(98, 119, 255, 0.38);
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 38px;
        padding: 54px 10px 26px;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        padding-right: 10px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.24);
        background: rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.08);
        color: var(--gold);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .eyebrow::before {
        content: "";
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--gold);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.9);
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 22px 0 18px;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 4vw + 1.2rem, 5.4rem);
        line-height: 0.95;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }

      .title-gradient {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6fbff 0%, #8ec4ff 20%, #8a7dff 52%, #f5c76d 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }

      .hero-copy p {
        max-width: 620px;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.9;
      }

      .cta-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      .hero-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(120px, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      .stat-card {
        padding: 18px 18px 16px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19, 25, 40, 0.92), rgba(12, 19, 28, 0.78));
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      }

      .stat-card strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 1vw + 1rem, 1.9rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .stat-card span {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 8px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .hero-panel {
        position: relative;
      }

      .panel-shell {
        position: relative;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 30px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 20, 31, 0.96), rgba(8, 12, 19, 0.96));
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .panel-shell::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        border-radius: 30px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(97, 168, 255, 0.12), rgba(133, 119, 255, 0.09), rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.09));
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .panel-badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: -12px;
        left: 26px;
        z-index: 2;
        padding: 9px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2), var(--gold));
        color: #07131f;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(98, 119, 255, 0.28);
      }

      .chat-window {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 640px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(158, 176, 214, 0.12);
        background: #08131d;
      }

      .chat-window iframe {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 640px;
        border: 0;
        background: #091421;
      }

      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 22px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .feature-card {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 26px 22px 24px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 24px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(17, 24, 38, 0.82), rgba(11, 17, 27, 0.76));
      }

      .feature-card::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0 auto auto 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 2px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2), var(--gold));
      }

      .feature-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(97, 168, 255, 0.16), rgba(133, 119, 255, 0.18), rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.12));
        border: 1px solid rgba(245, 199, 109, 0.18);
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        margin: 18px 0 12px;
        font-size: 1.26rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      @media (max-width: 980px) {
        .page-shell {
          padding: 18px 16px 48px;
        }

        .topbar {
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          justify-content: center;
        }

        nav {
          order: 3;
          width: 100%;
          justify-content: center;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          gap: 16px 22px;
        }

        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          padding-top: 42px;
        }

        .feature-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .header-actions {
          width: 100%;
          justify-content: center;
        }

        .cta-row,
        .hero-stats {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .cta-row {
          gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn {
          width: 100%;
        }

        .chat-window,
        .chat-window iframe {
          min-height: 520px;
          height: 520px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand" aria-label="2026 Data 로고">
          <span class="brand-mark">2026</span>
          <span>Data</span>
        </div>

        <nav aria-label="메인 메뉴">
          <a href="#services">Services</a>
          <a href="#solutions">Solutions</a>
          <a href="#insights">Insights</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="header-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button">Book a demo</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main class="hero">
        <section class="hero-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI Data Partner</span>
          <h1>
            Turn data into<br />
            <span class="title-gradient">a growth engine</span>
          </h1>
          <p>
            2026 Data helps organizations transform fragmented information into smarter decisions,
            higher-performing operations, and more meaningful customer experiences.
            Explore our AI-powered platform and get strategic guidance in real time.
          </p>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button">Get started</button>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button">View solutions</button>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-stats" aria-label="핵심 성과 지표">
            <div class="stat-card">
              <strong>24/7</strong>
              <span>AI support</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
              <strong>98%</strong>
              <span>issue resolution</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
              <strong>3x</strong>
              <span>efficiency gain</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="hero-panel" aria-label="AI 챗봇 상담">
          <div class="panel-shell">
            <div class="panel-badge">AI Chat</div>
            <div class="chat-window">
              <iframe
                src="https://copilotstudio.microsoft.com/environments/Default-bc52be20-d18a-4e38-a913-eec0a4df586e/bots/cre2b_bot_rg3HN4/webchat?__version__=2&enableFileAttachment=false&cliAgent=true"
                title="2026 Data AI assistant"
                allow="microphone; camera; geolocation"
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <section class="feature-grid" id="services">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Data Intelligence</h3>
          <p>
            Unify enterprise data, reveal hidden patterns, and convert operational complexity into
            actionable strategic insight for faster decision-making.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>AI Automation</h3>
          <p>
            Automate repetitive tasks and customer journeys with intelligent workflows that reduce
            operational friction and improve service quality at scale.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
          <h3>Growth Strategy</h3>
          <p>
            Build resilient growth plans through experimentation, performance tracking, and data-driven
            recommendations designed for sustainable expansion.
          </p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
